# Line endings for everything this skill ships and everything it writes.
#
# Without these entries a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true rewrites LF to
# CRLF. Two things then break and neither is visible in a diff: the `#!/usr/bin/env
# bash` shebang gains a trailing carriage return and the kernel cannot spawn the
# interpreter, and a recipe line's last argument gains a carriage return so a
# command fails with a message whose rendered bytes look correct.
*.sh        text eol=lf
*.mk        text eol=lf
Makefile    text eol=lf
makefile    text eol=lf
GNUmakefile text eol=lf
*.md        text eol=lf
*.yaml      text eol=lf
*.yml       text eol=lf
